@startuml
title Phase 10b — Console — plan

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

start

:10b.1 plan;

partition "Client" {
  :10b.2 control-plane client (contracts) + fake + httptest;
  :10b.3 read models / view models;
}

partition "Surfaces (one view-model layer)" {
  :10b.4 Surface interface + text (TUI) surface;
  :10b.5 local web surface (HTML + plain-text alt);
}

partition "Interaction" {
  :10b.6 typed commands + idempotency + audit + approvals;
}

:10b.7 entry point + tests + docs + summary;

stop

note right
  Console imports only contracts.
  Metadata-only rendering.
  Go stdlib only; no desktop (v2).
  Budget: ~7 commits (phase 10 total 10-15).
  TUI appearance/components: decided with maintainer.
end note

@enduml
